<hbr>
<font type {font_title} tint white atint white>
<ctext _sofbuddy_update_startup_stable_only atext "_sofbuddy_update_startup_stable_only : " noshade tip "1: startup popup only for stable releases from master. 0: startup uses Install version. Default 1."><br>
<font type {font_title} tint gray atint gray>
"Default 1 - Startup auto-update prompts are stable-only."
<hbr>
<hbr>
<ctext _sofbuddy_update_use_gui atext "_sofbuddy_update_use_gui : " noshade tip "Launch sof_buddy_update.exe on install. Universal builds default 1 (all flavours). Non-universal default 0."><br>
<font type {font_title} tint gray atint gray>
